From: Qianhui Xu <xiaqinghuan@mail.ustc.edu.cn>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] VerifiedBoot: bisect LoadImageAndAuth preamble (sbstop=16..19)

2026-11-05 y700-elden: vs-stop20（wrapper 入口）崩、fb-stop13（LoadImageAndAuth 之前）回话
⇒ 崩溃在 LoadImageAndAuth 的前导代码里。本补丁切四刀：

  16  LoadImageAndAuth 入口（WaitForFlashFinished 之前）
  17  WaitForFlashFinished 之后
  18  分区名块（FindBootableSlot）之后
  19  GetAVBVersion 之后

判据：diag st=Aborted last=[vs-N] ⇒ 该点之前不崩；无响应 ⇒ 崩在该点之前。
打序 19 → 18 → 17 → 16。

diff --git a/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/avb/VerifiedBoot.c b/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/avb/VerifiedBoot.c
index f43ed404..0a14c668 100644
--- a/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/avb/VerifiedBoot.c
+++ b/Platforms/QcomModulePkg/Library/avb/VerifiedBoot.c
@@ -1762,7 +1762,9 @@ LoadImageAndAuth (BootInfo *Info)
   QCOM_MDTP_PROTOCOL *MdtpProtocol;
   UINT32 AVBVersion = NO_AVB;
 
+  VS_STOP (16);
   WaitForFlashFinished ();
+  VS_STOP (17);
 
   if (Info == NULL) {
     DEBUG ((EFI_D_ERROR, "Invalid parameter Info\n"));
@@ -1821,7 +1823,9 @@ LoadImageAndAuth (BootInfo *Info)
     }
   }
 
+  VS_STOP (18);
   AVBVersion = GetAVBVersion ();
+  VS_STOP (19);
   DEBUG ((EFI_D_VERBOSE, "AVB version %d\n", AVBVersion));
   // 2026-11-04R14 y700-elden: RELEASE strips DEBUG(); print the two values that
   // decide whether a verification error is tolerated.  AsciiPrint = UefiLib (already
